    ``
    // Phase 2B: compute skip_str_ptr — the alloca ptr of the owned string
    // being returned (if any), so mem_drop_owned_strings doesn't free it.
    : ~ s skip_str_ptr ``
    : ~ s skip_user_ptr ``
    ? != 0 g_auto_drop_strings
    { : s rid_ptr ( nurl_sym_get2 syms ret_ident `__ptr` )
